# Media types (ImageShape, VideoShape, AudioShape)

For images, video and audio in the frontend, **always** use types from `@/shared/model/types`:

- **Images** → `ImageShape` (`src`, optionally `width`, `height`, `alt`, `title`)
- **Video** → `VideoShape` — array of `{ media?, src, type, captions? }`
- **Audio** → `AudioShape` (`src`, optionally `type`)

```ts
import type { ImageShape, VideoShape, AudioShape } from "@/shared/model/types";
```

## Do not

- Duplicate `VideoShape` / `AudioShape` under another name in props, `model/`, or `App*`

## Exceptions

- Extra fields (e.g. `caption`) — on the **parent** object next to `image: ImageShape`, not via a new image-like type

## Rendering

When a prop (or field) is typed as `ImageShape`, `VideoShape` or `AudioShape`, render it with the shared UI components — not raw `<img>` / `<video>` / `<audio>` / `<source>`.

| Prop type    | Component | Import                                                   |
| ------------ | --------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ImageShape` | `Image`   | `@/shared/ui/Image`                                      |
| `VideoShape` | `Video`   | `@/shared/ui/Video/Video.astro` (or `@/shared/ui/Video`) |
| `AudioShape` | `Audio`   | `@/shared/ui/Audio/Audio.astro` (or `@/shared/ui/Audio`) |

```astro
---
import Image from '@/shared/ui/Image';
import Video from '@/shared/ui/Video/Video.astro';
import Audio from '@/shared/ui/Audio/Audio.astro';
import type { ImageShape, VideoShape, AudioShape } from '@/shared/model/types';
---

{image && (
    <Image
        src={image.src}
        alt={image.alt ?? ''}
        width={image.width ?? 96}
        height={image.height ?? 96}
        title={image.title}
        sizes="(max-width: 767px) 50vw, 25vw"
    />
)}

{video && <Video sources={video} />}
{audio && <Audio source={audio} />}
```

- **`Image`**: pass `ImageShape` fields (`src`, `alt`, `width`, `height`, `title`) **and required `sizes`** from the mockup slot width (vw/px per breakpoint). ESLint `custom/require-image-sizes`. Defaults for optional `width` / `height` / `alt` when missing.
- **`Video`**: prop name is `sources` (type `VideoShape`); pass poster and other `<video>` attrs via component props.
- **`Audio`**: prop name is `source` (type `AudioShape`); pass `controls` and other `<audio>` attrs via component props. Transcript — on the parent block, not on `AudioShape`.

## Do not (markup)

- Raw `<img src={image.src} …>` when `image` is `ImageShape`
- Raw `<video>` / manual `<source>` loop when data is `VideoShape`
- Raw `<audio>` / manual `<source>` when data is `AudioShape`

## Examples (types)

```ts
// ✅
image?: ImageShape;

// ❌
sources: { src: string; type: string }[];

// ✅
video: VideoShape;

// ❌
src: string;

// ✅
audio: AudioShape;
```
